tance: 3 of 3. Reply with a corrected program and {\"action\": \"submit\"}, or with {\"action\": \"request_demos\"}.","reply":"```python\ndef transform(grid):\n    h, w = len(grid), len(grid[0])\n    from collections import Counter\n\n    # Background is the dominant color of the repeating interior.\n    bg = Counter(v for row in grid for v in row).most_common(1)[0][0]\n\n    # Grid lines are rows/columns whose dominant color differs from the background.\n    rs = [r for r in range(h) if Counter(grid[r]).most_common(1)[0][0] != bg]\n    cs = [c for c in range(w) if Counter(grid[r][c] for r in range(h)).most_common(1)[0][0] != bg]\n\n    if len(rs) < 2 or len(cs) < 2:\n        return [[bg]]\n\n    out = [[bg for _ in range(len(cs) - 1)] for _ in range(len(rs) - 1)]\n    for i, r in enumerate(rs[:-1]):\n        for j, c in enumerate(cs[1:]):\n            v = grid[r][c]\n            if v != bg:\n                out[i][j] = v\n    return out\n```\n{\"action\":\"submit\"}","steps":[],"action":{"type":"submit"}}]}